Hi [~accountid:712020:b3dbddb5-16a8-4ad6-9138-80fbe6e695a9], please allow me to re-assign this ticket to you. 

In response to this ticket, I think that we should:
1. Respond to the requestor with the identified articles of the T&Cs confirming that the Taxi Operators and passengers should be able to submit complaints on the Internal Complaints Handling System;
2. Ask Demetra, who handles these complaints _(i.e. if we add Greece, do we have the structure needed to receive and handle these complaints, who will receive these complaints)_;
3. Once Demetra has responded, ask them to submit a ticket to the WEB department to ask if they can add Greece to that page (this is more of an IT/Ops issue than a legal one). 

Happy to discuss further if you have any questions or a suggested alternative approach !

