{quote}Dear Agnieszka,

Thank you for your data subject rights request, which we received on 28 April 2025.

Please note that Bolt collects certain information about you, including your profile data and identification / verification data, to enhance the safety of its passengers and drivers. It is in Bolt’s legitimate interests (and the interests of its passengers) to enhance the safety and security of the Bolt services by offering safety functionalities. Further information can be found in our privacy notice available at [https://bolt.eu/pl-pl/privacy/privacy-for-riders/?category=rides|https://bolt.eu/pl-pl/privacy/privacy-for-riders/?category=rides|smart-link]  . This privacy notice also includes further information about:

* The categories of personal data we process;
* The purposes for which we process personal data;
* The recipients or categories of recipients to whom the personal data has been or will be disclosed;
* The criteria we use to determine how long to retain personal data;
* The sources of personal data received from other parties;
* The existence and envisaged consequences of any automated decision-making/profiling of personal data; and
* Details of any transfer of your personal data to third countries or international organisations and the safeguards used for any such transfers.

You have the right to request access to, rectification of or erasure of personal data or restriction of processing of personal data concerning you or to object to such processing. Any such requests that are received will be considered in conjunction with the applicable provisions of relevant data protection laws. If you are dissatisfied with this response to your request or in relation to any other matter relating to the processing of your personal data, we hope you will continue to work with us to resolve them. You have the right to complain directly to the appropriate supervisory authority and seek a judicial remedy. 

_Further to your deletion request, we confirm your request remains a priority among our teams and we are committed to providing you with a comprehensive response on this part of your request as soon as possible. We appreciate your patience and understanding._

If you have any additional questions, please let us know.

Yours sincerely,

*Bolt*{quote}

# {color:#bf2600}Once the date of the erasure is confirmed by the verification team, please send this update to the rider:{color}

Dear Agnieszka,

Further to our previous response on *DATE* we are writing to confirm that following your deletion request on 28 April 2025 your photos will be deleted from our databases by *DATE OF THE ERASURE*. Please note that this will not result in the deletion of your Bolt account.

Please do not hesitate to contact the Customer Support Team by replying to this email for any further information.

