** (ii) It may be worth checking if any contractual / common law duty of confidentiality still applies to the driver’s information (e.g., whether the Driver Terms contain confidentiality provisions that go beyond the driver’s death and/or whether any implied duties of confidentiality exist under UK law).

{panel:bgColor=#eae6ff}
*CONCLUSION*
