{panel}

* We suggest including a link to the French *passenger* privacy notice, which provides detailed information on data subject rights and how to contact Bolt’s DPO: [https://bolt.eu/fr-fr/privacy/privacy-for-riders/?category=rides|https://bolt.eu/fr-fr/privacy/privacy-for-riders/?category=rides|smart-link] 
