* *Questions*: 
> Do you know how much flexibility we have in editing the privacy notice template provided by Dailymotion? 
> More generally, are you expecting to have any ability to edit or manage the website directly, or will everything need to go through Dailymotion?

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
On Bolt being qualified as a Data Processor
{panel}

There appears to have been a small misunderstanding concerning Bolt being considered as a processor. The _Notice de confidentialité_ refers to Bolt as a data controller (see page 1), rather than a data processor. The same document does include a sentence which reads “_Your personal data is_ processed _by the Data Controller”,_ but this doesn’t alter our role from controller to processor. 

